 "duration": 20.81,
 "lines": "I heard a / scream for help / while falling / with my / headlights / off— / it was / the type of silent scream / a trapped lover makes to / escape / a pending marriage, / a concussion, / a set of walls caving inward / — / seething & simmering / in a solitude of / crowds & smiles.",
